<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Nov industrial production rises 3.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish Nov industrial production rises 3.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial production rose 3.1 percent in November, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION</p>
<p>  (Percentage change)   NOV 96   OCT 96     YR/YR</p>
<p>			     +3.1	 -1.3	 +4.8</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
